---
import { OFFER_SITES } from '../consts';
---

<div class="notice" id="disclosure" role="note" aria-label="Disclosure about third-party token websites">
  <p class="notice__title">
    <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 17 17" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M8.5 1.6 15 3.9v4.2c0 3.9-2.7 6.4-6.5 7.4-3.8-1-6.5-3.5-6.5-7.4V3.9l6.5-2.3Z" stroke="#7a3413" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
      <path d="M8.5 5.4v3.4M8.5 11.3v.1" stroke="#7a3413" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
    </svg>
    Disclosure — third-party token websites
  </p>
  <p>
    Examples of third-party token-offer websites may include
    {OFFER_SITES.map((site, i) => (
      <>
        <a href={site.url} rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">{site.label}</a>{i < OFFER_SITES.length - 1 ? (i === OFFER_SITES.length - 2 ? ' and ' : ', ') : ''}
      </>
    ))}.
    These websites are <strong>not presented as official Stripchat properties</strong>.
    Users should independently verify their legitimacy, security, privacy policy,
    terms, eligibility requirements and current availability before using them.
    <strong>Never share your password, payment details, 2FA code or recovery information.</strong>
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 0.6rem;">
    StripChat is an adults-only platform (18+). This page is informational and
    independent; promotions, draws and token availability can change or end at
    any time without notice.
  </p>
</div>
